{"id":"drang","lemma":"Drang","pos":"noun","rank":4623,"glosses":["pressure; stress","urge; impulse; longing"],"ipa":"/dʁaŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f2/De-Drang.ogg/De-Drang.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Dranges","plural":"Dränge"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich verspüre keinen Drang danach.","en":"I have no desire to do that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to feel, sense","l":"verspüren"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null,{"g":"after it, after that"}]},{"text":"Das Wasser drang in die Mauern ein.","en":"The water penetrated the walls.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"water"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"to build a wall"},{"g":"a"}]},{"text":"Der Dieb drang unbemerkt ein.","en":"The thief got in without being noticed.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"thief"},null,{"g":"unnoticed"},{"g":"a"}]},{"text":"Der Dolch drang in sein Herz ein.","en":"The dagger penetrated his heart.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"dagger"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"heart"},{"g":"a"}]},{"text":"Ich verspürte den Drang, laut zu schreien.","en":"I felt an impulse to cry out loud.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to feel, sense","l":"verspüren"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"according to"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to shout"}]}]}